      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ2amsYAMBBDQRXt2ukHfl-TI/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQweUtXcTZnRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 年前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "糟糕透頂。偶然發現這家新酒吧，就跟兩個朋友進去看看。我們是唯一的客人。雞尾酒簡直難以下嚥。莫吉托嘗起來像牙膏。伏特加青檸簡直就是糖水和青檸汁的混合，完全嚐不出酒精味。我們跟服務生說了酒很難喝，他們居然只是點點頭。真是匪夷所思。更莫名其妙的是，每杯酒居然都配上了四根塑膠吸管。我們以後絕對不會再來了。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Horrifically terrible. Noticed this new bar and stopped in with two friends. We were the only patrons. Cocktails are undrinkable. Mojito tasted like toothpaste. Vodka-lime is a diabetic mix of sugar water and Limeaid. Cannot detect any alcohol in the drinks. We told the staff that drinks were terrible and they just nodded. Bizarre. Also inexplicably served with no fewer than FOUR plastic straws. We will never come back.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Sarah Churgin",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115604773762261196160/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXGm_MKwk0rjzMHSMBDuP5TYN-cYVrVG9hGSPHpcL3jhV0QUQJS-w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2"
        },
        "publishTime": "2019-10-20T12:44:01.585835Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQweUtXcTZnRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQweUtXcTZnRRAB!2m1!1s0x3404010360aca9d9:0x32f9e57790aedd5e"
