        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 年前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "這家店的服務絕對需要改進。除了最初的訂單之外，他們似乎對其他顧客漠不關心。另外令人驚訝的是，有好幾家店都叫這個名字。所以最好多確認一下。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Definitely needs a better hospitality. They don't have any concern after the initial order.  Also surprising to note there several places with the same name. So better to have a double check",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
